{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Graveyard 404, a first-person psychological horror game where your observation skills are your only weapon against a living nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caught in a repeating death loop within a haunted graveyard, you must meticulously scan your surroundings for anomalies\u2014anything out of place\u2014to find the path forward. Succeed, and you might escape. Fail, and the nightmare resets.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/5fed5adabbb72bcebd75b73a2b4fa8bd.avif?t=1752566065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/b7e2d921cb23fcd7d53e764983764164.avif?t=1752566065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/12b6b4e64c7ac48c889db5a0a821cc3b.avif?t=1752566065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/0190fbd4c76d175878cf5a7ca19c0277.avif?t=1752566065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/3ea62258aaeab9e713cda05ff3b3b3de.avif?t=1752566065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/extras/7ed805db0f955941d59f28196b840e1d.avif?t=1752566065\" /></div><br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spot the Difference to Survive:</strong> This isn't just a walking simulator. Your core task is to identify over 32 unique and unsettling anomalies, from misplaced objects to otherworldly intruders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break the Death Loop:</strong> The graveyard repeats, but small changes offer a way out. Successfully report all anomalies in a cycle to progress. Miss one, and you're back at the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve Ritualistic Puzzles:</strong> Finding an anomaly is only the first step. You must locate and use items like incense to perform the correct ritual and cleanse the evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and success rate will lead to one of 5 different endings. Replay to discover them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Dread, No Jumpscares:</strong> The terror builds from the oppressive atmosphere and sound design, not cheap startling tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Focused Horror Experience:</strong> A single playthrough lasts between 30-90 minutes, perfect for a concentrated dose of horror.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846620?t=1752566065","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846620?t=1752566065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/51d1f2d00f5571b19dfbe5ff43a72fb0de7492f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752566065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/51d1f2d00f5571b19dfbe5ff43a72fb0de7492f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752566065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing"