isn't just a walking simulator. Your core task is to identify over 32 unique and unsettling anomalies, from misplaced objects to otherworldly intruders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break the Death Loop:</strong> The graveyard repeats, but small changes offer a way out. Successfully report all anomalies in a cycle to progress. Miss one, and you're back at the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve Ritualistic Puzzles:</strong> Finding an anomaly is only the first step. You must locate and use items like incense to perform the correct ritual and cleanse the evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices and success rate will lead to one of 5 different endings. Replay to discover them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Dread, No Jumpscares:</strong> The terror builds from the oppressive atmosphere and sound design, not cheap startling tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Focused Horror Experience:</strong> A single playthrough lasts between 30-90 minutes, perfect for a concentrated dose of horror.</p></li></ul>","developers":["RenStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846620/46723f1e81b37f2a876fe2a554791a6d93113f62/header.jpg?t=1752566065","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257163307,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163307/movie480.mp4?t=1752005058","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163307/movie_max.mp4?t=1752005058"},"name":"new404","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163307/39d225e2a4b98414486024e9cc86cb21b4ccf836/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752005058","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c